      "markdown": "## Subcontracting",
      "plain_text": "Subcontracting"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e3b52206e82f::b0005",
      "section_id": "e3b52206e82f::s003",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Manage a contract - Subcontracting",
        "Buyer's Guide",
        "Subcontracting"
      ],
      "markdown": "A contractor must first use the permission to subcontract form to obtain consent from the buyer before subcontracting. Subsequently, the contractor must certify that the subcontract follow the same conditions as the main contract. Approval from the buyer depends on their satisfaction with both the subcontractor and the proposed subcontract.",
      "plain_text": "A contractor must first use the permission to subcontract form to obtain consent from the buyer before subcontracting. Subsequently, the contractor must certify that the subcontract follow the same conditions as the main contract. Approval from the buyer depends on their satisfaction with both the subcontractor and the proposed subcontract."
    },
